su name android wakeup home be ceremony def
  su name wakeup key ob text "KEYCODE_WAKEUP" be android press do
  su name unlock glide ob ve num 540 2000 540 300 be android glide do
  su name home key ob text "KEYCODE_HOME" be android press do
  be android input do
  be android produce do
  accordingto text "home key" during num 8000 be android await do
prah

be android wakeup home do
